  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />(i) Case- <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></math> :-</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Then the A.P. is <math><mo>→</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mn>0</mn></math><br />(ii) Case- <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></math> :-<br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Then the A.P. is <math><mo>→</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mn>0</mn></math><br />(ii) Case- <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></math> :-<br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></menclose><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />(not possible)<br />Hence, the required sum is&nbsp;<math><mn>350</mn></math> or <math><mn>180</mn></math></p>",
